        "TileImage": "$($repository a8274a75-25ce-4b84-81ee-766500d58399).Image",
        "Description": "Mission: Operation – Très Problematic\rLocation: Paris\r\rThree high-profile agents of chaos—Bob Moran, Amedee Paquin, and Mark Parker—are causing maximum disruption with minimum reason. Your objective is to deal with all three while blending into the crowd of confused tourists. Stay cool, stay subtle, and try not to get distracted by the sheer absurdity of the situation.\r\rObjective: Neutralize all targets.\rStyle Bonus: The more dramatic, the better.",
